    "name_raw": "Expanded Fiendish Resistance",
    "definition_type_raw": "Tiefling",
    "source_book_raw": null,
    "definition_raw": "You gain extra fiendish resistances.   Prerequisites: Tiefling. Benefit: Pick one of the following energy types that you do not already have resistance to: acid, cold, electricity, or fire. You gain resistance 5 to that energy type. Special: You can take this feat multiple times. Each time you do, pick another energy type you do not have resistance to. You gain resistance 5 to that energy type.",
